	(text "NOTE: the minutes and seconds decades displays are flipped\non the PCB with the DP to the top left to create a slant\nsemicolon.\n\nFor this reason segments are not mapped A->A but A->D etc. \nso that from software perspective all digits work the \nsame.\n\nPay attention to pin1 position on the PCB when assembling."
